      en: "Alba Medina, new sales assistant at Store 03 (Bilbao), could not get into StockTienda: its log showed DENIED, no GG-Store-Txx group. Her account had been created by copying a head-office user (smolina), so it only had GG-M365-F3; her colleague Nora has GG-Store-T03. Added her to GG-Store-T03 only (not to every store, and no shared login with the manager) and she signed in again: the log shows OK, store T03, role Sales assistant. Asked HR to copy new store staff from the store's template user and to add the store field to the onboarding form.",
