      en: "Inventory over Redfish before starting: 14 iDRACs on 6.10.80.00, 4 already on 7.00.00.172 and two R640 in Zaragoza (ZAR-VMH03/04) on 5.10.50.00, whose jobs had failed because 7.00 needs 6.00.30.00 or later: that, and going one by one through the web page, is why the earlier attempt stalled. Checked the packages' hashes, then in batch with rfbatch: 6.10.80.00 only for the two on 5.10.50.00, and 7.00.00.172 for all (16 updated, 4 skipped, 0 failed, servers running). Inventory after: 20 of 20 on 7.00.00.172; health 20/20 reachable with no new critical SEL entries; Bruno has the list before and after. Next: a firmware baseline checked every quarter with the same batch and inventory.",
