        en: "SaludNet's vendor has to install version 8.4 before 1 December, because the new e-prescription module is mandatory from that day. They say it needs three hours with SaludNet stopped, and they have proposed Tuesday 24 November at 10:00, 'because our team only works office hours'. I represent the wards on the SaludNet committee. Please decide when and how we do it, and tell me what the wards will have to do.",
